menu "Blinky (app nay)"

config BLINKY_DELAY_LOOPS
    int "So vong lap delay giua moi lan toggle LED"
    default 500000
    help
        Delay busy-loop (chua co SysTick/NEON_Delay that - xem comment trong
        Src/main.c) - tang gia tri de LED nhay CHAM hon, giam de nhay NHANH
        hon. Doc qua CONFIG_BLINKY_DELAY_LOOPS trong Src/main.c.

        Vi du menuconfig KET HOP: option nay la CUA RIENG app Blinky (khong
        thuoc SDK), xuat hien CUNG 1 menu voi cac option cua SDK
        (components/driver) - xem neon-mdf/Kconfig + cmake/kconfig.cmake.

endmenu
